{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04119","headline":"蔡起居山亭 · 徐晶","name":"蔡起居山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文史归休日，栖闲卧草亭。\n蔷薇一架紫，石竹数重青。\n垂露和仙药，烧香诵道经。\n莫将山水弄，持与世人听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐晶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}